sequenceDiagram
  actor Player as 参加者
  participant UI as Local Participant Portal
  participant API as Local HTTP API
  participant Runner as ProblemLifecycle / ContainerRunner
  participant Docker as Docker daemon
  participant Problem as 問題コンテナ
  participant DB as SQLite

  Player->>UI: 問題を開始
  UI->>API: POST /portal/me/problems/:id/start
  API->>Runner: ensureRunning
  API-->>UI: 202 / 起動処理受付
  Runner->>Runner: Compose検査・ポート調整・所有情報の記録
  Runner->>Docker: compose up -d --build
  Docker->>Problem: 問題環境を起動
  Runner->>Problem: verifierと必要なURLの準備完了確認
  UI->>API: 起動状態を再取得
  API-->>UI: runningまたは起動エラー

  Player->>UI: 解答を提出
  UI->>API: POST /portal/me/submit-flag / Bearer
  API->>API: 稼働中・対象問題・既提出を確認
  API->>Problem: POST /verify
  alt 正常に正誤判定を取得
    Problem-->>API: correct等の判定情報
    API->>API: 加減点・解答済み状態・履歴を更新
    API->>DB: persist / 状態スナップショット保存
    API-->>UI: 判定結果・得点
  else 接続失敗または不正な応答
    API-->>UI: 502 verify_unavailable
  end
